# synstudio effect
name    scanlines
label   Scanlines
group   Screen
about   Every other line darkened, the way a tube drew a picture
param   depth  0.4  0  1  Depth
filter  [$in]format=gbrap,geq=r='r(X,Y)*(1-$depth*mod(Y\,2))':
filter  g='g(X,Y)*(1-$depth*mod(Y\,2))':b='b(X,Y)*(1-$depth*mod(Y\,2))':
filter  a='alpha(X,Y)'[$out]
